### ============================================================
### Agent Service -- REST entry point (FastAPI :8000)
### ============================================================

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### Run pipeline - Research a crypto project
POST http://localhost:8000/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "input": "Research the Bittensor crypto project"
}

### Run pipeline - Another project
POST http://localhost:8000/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "input": "Research the Solana crypto project, what are the latest facts about the technical aspects and development progress"
}

### Validation - too short (expect 422)
POST http://localhost:8000/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "input": "ab"
}

### ============================================================
### crypto-intelligence MCP Server -- MCP entry point (:8001)
###
### The MCP server exposes `research_crypto_project(project_name)`
### which runs the same 5-agent pipeline as POST /run above.
###
### MCP tools are NOT callable via REST -- connect with an MCP client:
###
###   Claude Desktop: add to %APPDATA%\Claude\claude_desktop_config.json
###     { "mcpServers": { "crypto-intelligence": { "url": "http://localhost:8001/sse" } } }
###
###   Claude Code:
###     claude mcp add --transport sse crypto-intelligence http://localhost:8001/sse
###
### Verify MCP server is alive:
### ============================================================

### MCP SSE endpoint - verify it responds (opens SSE stream)
GET http://localhost:8001/sse
